  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestine Cultural Fund - phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PCF will support Palestinian cultural institutions and individual artists as the target group of the Fund. It is important to mention that priority will be given to funding projects implemented in Jerusalem, Area C and Gaza as priority areas for PCF. The PCF will also support the MoC in developing a database for the sector as well as enhancing its monitoring and evaluation capacity principally through the development and monitoring of the sector&#x2019;s indictors.</narrative>
  </description>
